  "_note": "Committed, hermetic mutation spec for the quiz-integrity role corpus (H3). Replaces the ephemeral /private/tmp spec of E-09. A builder MUST fail closed if this file is missing (never []), and MUST fail closed rather than shrink below expectedComposition. Every case runs the two-phase blindness protocol (phase-1 key-blind derivation committed by hash BEFORE phase-2 key-visible adjudication). The deterministic answer-tell heuristic and key-correctness are model-independent; the semantic adjudicator elicits defensibleAnswerIndices + keyedMechanismSupported (quiz-integrity-adjudication-v1). All paths RELATIVE or bookIds against an INJECTED bookPackagesDir; no absolute or temp paths, no canonical state-dir literal.",
  "governance": {
    "definitionsFrozenBeforeLiveOutput": true,
    "calibrationVsHoldoutSeparated": true,
    "holdoutImmutableOnceLiveQualificationBegins": true,
    "noInCampaignInstrumentTreadmill": "a material instrument defect terminates the experiment id and starts a NEW id",
    "independentHumanRater": false,
    "everyAmbiguityGoldSurvivesAdversarialSingleBestAnswer": true,
    "noBorderlineAmbiguityAsHoldout": true
  },
  "cleanBaseScoreLedger": "clean-base-score-ledger.v1.json",
  "minRenderBytes": 8000,
  "requiresPhase2": true,
