    "note": "each soft denominator >= 10 (E-07 fix, replacing the retired 0.85-over-4 quiz-ambiguity brittleness); minKeyMismatchDetectionRate is a 1.0 bar over the 10 key-mismatch cases and is exempt from the soft floor"
  },
  "variantShape": "{ variantKey, baseBookId, baseChapter, kind, targetQuestionIndex1?, ops:[{path,op,value}], expected, goldRationale, builderGenerated?, ownerAuthoredOps? }. 'uniquely-correct-clean' has ops:[] (unmutated). 'key-mismatch' is builderGenerated (the builder mints a correctIndex swap deterministically to a wrong option at /quiz/questions/<i>/correctIndex). 'genuine-ambiguity' and 'mechanism-causal-key' are ownerAuthoredOps (two-defensible-answer questions and mechanism-dependent keyed answers are owner-authored gold, never fabricated here); the builder fails closed until ops are supplied.",
